  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个Serilum模组。用心制作。大量适用于Fabric、Forge和Neo的活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>磨刀石磨利工具是一款极简主义模组，它增加了磨刀石能够临时提升在它上面使用过的工具伤害的能力。</p>\n<p>通过<strong>潜行+右键点击</strong>磨刀石来磨利任何工具。这会为工具赋予<strong>N</strong>次磨利使用次数（可在配置中定义）。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含在《原版体验》整合包中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"包含在Serilum的RPG捆绑包中\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>显示隐藏内容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>usesAfterGrinding</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 32，最小值 1，最大值 5000<br>&nbsp;在磨刀石上使用工具后，该工具获得的磨利使用次数。<br><br><span><strong>sharpenedDamageModifier</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 1.5，最小值 0，最大值 100.0<br>&nbsp;磨利工具的伤害倍率。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>sendUsesLeftInChat</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>&nbsp;在剩余次数为75%、50%、25%、10%时向磨利工具的使用者发送消息。<br><br><span><strong>showUsesLeftInItemName</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>&nbsp;在物品名称中显示剩余使用次数。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>nameUsesPrefix</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 \"(磨利次数：\"<br>&nbsp;工具名称中磨利剩余次数的前缀。<br><br><span><strong>nameUsesSuffix</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 =&nbsp; \")\"<br>&nbsp;工具名称中磨利剩余次数的后缀。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><strong>手持工具潜行并右键点击磨刀石：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grindstone-sharper-tools/a.jpg\" alt=\"0\" width=\"1423\" height=\"827\"></strong><br><br><strong>这样就会磨利工具，并且（可通过配置选择）将信息添加到物品名称中。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grindstone-sharper-tools/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"684\" height=\"281\"></strong><br><br><strong>攻击任何实体时，伤害会增加配置中设定的倍率：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grindstone-sharper-tools/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"664\"></strong><br><br><span><strong>同时也可以通过配置选择在聊天中收到剩余使用次数的提示：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grindstone-sharper-tools/d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"137\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模组，前提是下载内容仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事项，请使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
